strings=mast('Learn together.<br><em>Play together.</em>','Explore Accelerated Strings Lab, FM Studios’ group strings program. Ask about the current group, experience levels, and enrollment options.','Accelerated Strings Lab')+'<section class="wrap detail-grid"><div>'+eyebrow('The joy of an ensemble')+'<h2>Your part.<br><em>A shared sound.</em></h2></div><div><p class="lead">A weekly session brings focused learning and ensemble playing together.</p><p>FM’s published program description combines individual-style instruction with time spent playing as a group in a one-hour weekly session. Musicians explore music reading, keeping time and playing with others. The format introduces music in class so students can revisit familiar pieces at home.</p><p>Tell us your instrument and playing experience to discuss whether the program fits your next step. Confirm the current format, location, schedule, fees and available places with the school; the published program page includes older semester information.</p>'+link(OPUS+'/lead','Ask about Strings Lab '+arrow(),'button',True)+'</div></section>'+cta('Keep your music growing.','Explore private lessons alongside the group program.')
