review=mast('A fresh look.<br><em>Ready for your feedback.</em>','Explore the proposed website on your phone and computer, then share the changes you would like to see.','FM Studios · Owner review')+'<section class="wrap review-layout"><div><h2>What to review</h2><ol class="review-list"><li><strong>Look and feel</strong><p>The original FM blue, black, white, and gray palette, logo, photography, typography, and overall personality of the school. Review the Instagram and Facebook displays on the homepage, too.</p></li><li><strong>Lessons and people</strong><p>Instrument descriptions, instructor names and roles, and lesson formats. Tell us any age requirements or availability details that should be added.</p></li><li><strong>Locations and booking</strong><p>Addresses, trial booking paths, in-home service areas, and the listed travel fee. Confirm any pricing details before publication.</p></li><li><strong>Your visitor’s experience</strong><p>Try the menu, instrument pages, location pages, and phone links on mobile.</p></li></ol></div><aside class="review-note"><h2>About this preview</h2><p>This is a proposed redesign for review. FM’s current website is still the live school website.</p><p>Booking and inquiry buttons open the school’s existing systems. No new tracking or advertising changes are connected to this preview.</p><p>Send your feedback to '+link('mailto:admin@stoneridgedigital.com','admin@stoneridgedigital.com')+'. Copy your notes into an email reply, or open a prepared email below.</p><label for="review-notes">Your notes</label><textarea id="review-notes" rows="7" placeholder="Page name, requested change, and any updated details…"></textarea><div class="review-actions"><button class="button" id="copy-review" type="button">Copy feedback</button><a class="button secondary" id="email-review" href="mailto:admin@stoneridgedigital.com?subject=FM%20Studios%20website%20feedback">Open feedback email</a><button class="text-link clear-notes" id="clear-review" type="button">Clear saved notes</button></div><p class="fine" id="review-storage">Notes are saved only in this browser on this device until you clear them. Nothing is sent automatically.</p><p id="review-status" role="status" class="fine"></p><noscript><p>Copy your notes before leaving this page. Saving and prepared email text require JavaScript.</p></noscript></aside></section><section class="wrap review-links"><h2>Explore every page</h2><div>'+''.join(link(p['slug']+'.html',re.sub(r' \|.*','',p['title']),'review-page-link') for p in pages)+link('404.html','Page not found (404)','review-page-link')+'</div></section>'
